# The build needs Go sources, go.mod/go.sum and the embedded queries/ and
# template files -- nothing else. Everything below only bloats the build
# context (node_modules alone is hundreds of megabytes) and busts the source
# layer cache on files the binary never sees.
.git
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
deploy/cloudflare/node_modules
deploy/cloudflare/dist
deploy/observability
deploy/terraform
docs
testdata/golden/**/*.pdf
*.md
